{"api":"openai-completions","content":[{"text":"I'll analyze the recommendation task. Let me understand the requirements:\n\n- Target: 20 distinct candidates\n- Interest: 家常烹饪 (home cooking), focusing on reproducible methods, ingredient handling, and cooking principles. Explicitly NOT interested in restaurant business operations or kitchen appliance promotions.\n- Working set: 120 candidates exposed\n\nLet me examine the candidates. The interest description explicitly states: \"家常烹饪，关注可复现做法、食材处理和烹饪原理，不关注餐饮门店经营或厨电促销。\" (Home cooking, focusing on reproducible methods, ingredient handling, and cooking principles, NOT interested in restaurant store operations or kitchen appliance promotions.)\n\nSo I should avoid candidates that are \"市场观察\" (market observation) type content, which analyze restaurant chains, franchise contracts, delivery promotions, and kitchen appliance discounts. These directly contradict the user's explicit preference.\n\nLet me categorize the candidates by their content type based on titles/descriptions:\n\nContent types I can identify:\n1. **概念速览** (concept overview) - lists common concepts, provides question catalog\n2. **操作记录** (operation record) - gives ingredient amounts, processing order, heating intensity/time, batch comparisons, adjustment steps\n3. **条件与原理** (conditions and principles) - explains how moisture, temperature, food structure affect texture\n4. **专题观察** (special topic observation) - introduces local food history, festivals, table etiquette, dish name evolution, folk stories\n5. **市场观察** (market observation) - analyzes restaurant chains, franchise contracts, delivery promotions, kitchen appliance discounts ← EXCLUDE\n\nThe user's interest is about reproducible methods, ingredient handling, and cooking principles. They explicitly don't care about restaurant business or kitchen appliance promotions.\n\nSo the \"市场观察\" content should be excluded as it directly contradicts the explicit preference.\n\nThe \"专题观察\" content is about local food history, festivals, table etiquette, dish name evolution, folk stories. This is somewhat tangential to \"可复现做法、食材处理和烹饪原理\" but it's about food culture/history, not restaurant business. Hmm. It's not directly about cooking methods. But it's not explicitly excluded either. The user wants reproducible methods, ingredient handling, cooking principles. The 专题观察 content is about food history/culture which is less aligned but not excluded.\n\nLet me focus on the most relevant content types:\n- **操作记录** (operation records) - directly about reproducible methods, ingredient amounts, processing order, adjustments. Highly relevant.\n- **条件与原理** (conditions and principles) - directly about cooking principles (moisture, temperature, structure). Highly relevant.\n- **概念速览** (concept overview) - lists concepts, provides question catalog for further reading. Relevant as an entry point.\n\nThe 专题观察 content about food history/culture is less aligned with the user's stated focus on reproducible methods and cooking principles. I'll deprioritize these.\n\nLet me count the candidates. There are 120 candidates exposed (workingSetCount 120). I need to select 20.\n\nLet me identify the relevant candidates. Given the user's interest in home cooking with reproducible methods, ingredient handling, and cooking principles, I should prioritize:\n1. 操作记录 (operation records)\n2. 条件与原理 (conditions and principles)\n3. 概念速览 (concept overview)\n\nAnd exclude 市场观察 (market observation) which directly contradicts the explicit preference.\n\nLet me also consider balance across dishes. The dishes/topics present:\n- 煎豆腐 (pan-fried tofu)\n- 煎饺 (pan-fried dumplings)\n- 米饭含水量 (rice water content)\n- 清汤调味 (clear soup seasoning)\n- 蒸鱼 (steamed fish)\n- 番茄炒蛋 (tomato scrambled eggs)\n- 鸡胸肉口感 (chicken breast texture)\n- 面团发酵 (dough fermentation)\n- 炖牛肉 (braised beef)\n- 蔬菜焯水 (vegetable blanching)\n\nLet me collect the candidates that are 操作记录, 条件与原理, and 概念速览, excluding 市场观察 and 专题观察.\n\nLet me go through the list and identify candidates by their content type. Given the large number, let me focus on selecting 20 well-balanced candidates.\n\nLet me identify all the relevant (non-market, non-special-topic) candidates:\n\n**煎豆腐 (tofu):**\n- item-020de9869dd2: 概念速览 (两人晚餐)\n- item-0714769b6401: 条件与原理 (两人晚餐)\n- item-085ac75e2f6f: 操作记录 (家庭周末午餐)\n- item-23f5c563d2ef: 概念速览 (工作日备餐)\n- item-38f0ccd279f8: 概念速览 (家庭周末午餐)\n- item-5adc97f63de0: 条件与原理 (工作日备餐)\n- item-6b3f92132717: 条件与原理 (小份试做)\n- item-79ea9990101c: 操作记录 (工作日备餐)\n\n**煎饺 (dumplings):**\n- item-024e99402549: 操作记录 (工作日备餐)\n- item-0c84c8a43664: 概念速览 (两人晚餐)\n- item-184d19ff8d00: 概念速览 (家庭周末午餐)\n- item-3302498cd23d: 条件与原理 (两人晚餐)\n- item-4736b753745c: 操作记录 (家庭周末午餐)\n- item-508ee443dfc5: 条件与原理 (小份试做)\n- item-5fbfb91f237f: 概念速览 (工作日备餐)\n- item-76a48bfcc5ba: 操作记录 (小份试做)\n- item-7755041161ff: 概念速览 (小份试做)\n- item-88c0778a9f05: 条件与原理 (工作日备餐)\n\n**米饭含水量 (rice):**\n- item-02a590570d92: 专题观察 (工作日备餐) - exclude\n- item-04a021be58f9: 专题观察 (小份试做) - exclude\n- item-1635bae1e58d: 操作记录 (家庭周末午餐)\n- item-2395d5837e77: 概念速览 (工作日备餐)\n- item-41f1925e3d74: 操作记录 (工作日备餐)\n- item-620ee1fc9bb0: 概念速览 (家庭周末午餐)\n- item-661c765aa841: 专题观察 (家庭周末午餐) - exclude\n- item-7caafc64af77: 条件与原理 (家庭周末午餐)\n- item-7e988a51c89c: 概念速览 (小份试做)\n\n**清汤调味 (soup):**\n- item-02ec789dd9bf: 操作记录 (家庭周末午餐)\n- item-0a89c23b1888: 概念速览 (小份试做)\n- item-1699013c1d59: 概念速览 (两人晚餐)\n- item-20168695fc11: 条件与原理 (家庭周末午餐)\n- item-39131d1ff5ce: 条件与原理 (小份试做)\n- item-4835e99fe5fb: 概念速览 (工作日备餐)\n- item-5dfd02cf6e3a: 操作记录 (工作日备餐)\n- item-5f4330608ded: 概念速览 (家庭周末午餐)\n- item-634a3326befd: 条件与原理 (两人晚餐)\n- item-693e18a58e5e: 操作记录 (小份试做)\n\n**蒸鱼 (fish):**\n- item-06cfb2d4505b: 概念速览 (工作日备餐)\n- item-0ac37da79bac: 条件与原理 (工作日备餐)\n- item-1c397a8e1683: 概念速览 (两人晚餐)\n- item-1d12fb72a0b5: 操作记录 (家庭周末午餐)\n- item-2062e507d111: 操作记录 (两人晚餐)\n- item-33a0f6fe41f5: 条件与原理 (小份试做)\n- item-34eb4892cc8d: 条件与原理 (家庭周末午餐)\n- item-3632e4c9f026: 概念速览 (家庭周末午餐)\n- item-3d019adece36: 概念速览 (小份试做)\n- item-6ea61df40864: 条件与原理 (两人晚餐)\n- i